},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近のあみの写真フォルダには、ななの「にんじんっ」て感じの顔が増えつつあるよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん～～～～～！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人pvちょっと解禁されてますね恥ずかしい！8割どいやさんですがよろしくヽ(●＾▽＾●)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで節分ですね今日は～。何年か前はぱぱが鬼になって家族で豆投げてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな様子を喧嘩と勘違いして、むぎ太が吠えて走り回ってたのが懐かしいです！あの豆ってめっちゃ美味しいですよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読んでるんだ！？ってコメントがありましたけど、しっかり読んでますよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に読んだときより数字が増えてたら「あっ増えてる」ってまた読んでます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(ｏ'∀'ｏ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…髪の毛短くなりました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バイッッッ"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18420":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表。\nもうこのブログも9回目になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は、本当にたくさんの方が選抜を期待してくださっていて、\n私もその期待に応えたくて......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけどだめで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","tex